182	    ```
183	
184	- [x] **Task 3: Backend-Tests (xUnit v3)** (AC: 1, 2, 3, 5)
185	  - [x] `seed-b-backend.Tests/Application/RatingServiceTests.cs` (NEU) — SQLite-In-Memory-Muster identisch zu `CatalogServiceTests`/`RatingConfigurationTests`:
